# Tests and generated test support
# Existing tracked tests remain tracked; these rules prevent new local test
# files and test-output trees from being added accidentally.
tests/
test/
**/tests/
**/test/
test_*.py
*_test.py
*Test.java
*Tests.java
test-results/
test-results-*/
pytest-report*/
junit*.xml

# Test suites are developer material and are not published. Confirmed
# 2026-08-19: the published set is code a user needs to run the project, and the
# suites plus their fixtures were 265 files / 149,862 lines of it -- including a
# single 77,555-line machine-written recording
# (tests/fidelity/fixtures/world/native_crafting_catalog_recording.json).
# The Java suite under hytale-plugin/src/test was already excluded by **/test/
# above; these negations were the only reason the Python suites still shipped.
#
# Consequence to keep in mind: nothing published can run a test. Any CI job must
# either add these back deliberately or test against a source checkout.

